#===============================================================================
# Abstract Reordered: combo style shared by every character (generated - see side notes)
#
# 1. Chains: a normal that hit or was blocked can go into any other light / medium / heavy
#    (up or down in strength, standing or crouching), each one once per string. Air normals
#    chain the same way, except for Johnny.
# 2. Launch jump cancel: when your attack launches them, press up to jump after them.
#    Once per combo. Any move that launches counts (Johnny's rising shot included).
# 3. Rapid Cancel: A+B+C on a hit or block, costs 1 bar, ends the move at once.
#===============================================================================
[StateDef -4]

